OL,3,APolice officers reunite with baby they
OL,4,Ahelped deliver in back of car
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers who were first on
OL,7,Fthe scene as a woman gave birth in the
OL,8,Fback of a car have been reunited with
OL,9,Fthe baby they helped care for.
OL,11,FThey had been taking part in a routine
OL,12,Ftraffic operation in Ballymena, County
OL,13,FAntrim, on 9 October when they were
OL,14,Fapproached by the father running
OL,15,Ftowards them.
OL,17,FConstable Campbell, who has been in the
OL,18,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,19,F(PSNI) for almost two years, said it
OL,20,Fwasn't something they were expecting.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
